 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 21807,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"1574\" data-start=\"380\">\n\t<li data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"380\">\n\t<p data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"316\">An AND gate is a digital logic gate that gives a <strong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"450\">HIGH output (1)</strong> <strong data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"470\">only when all its inputs are HIGH (1)</strong>. If any input is LOW (0), the output will be LOW. It performs logical multiplication.</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"599\"><strong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"599\">Truth Table:</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>A</th>\n\t\t\t<th>B</th>\n\t\t\t<th>A &middot; B</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1579\" data-start=\"1576\" />",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSS201T",
   "LEVEL": 1,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain the working principle and truth table of an AND gate.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 109,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 21807
  },
  {
   "_id": 21823,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"1574\" data-start=\"380\">\n\t<li data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"380\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1059\" data-start=\"805\">An OR gate outputs <strong data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"917\">HIGH (1)</strong> if <strong data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"933\">any one or more</strong> of its inputs are HIGH. It only outputs LOW (0) when <strong data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"1006\">all inputs are LOW</strong>. It performs logical addition.</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1061\"><strong data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1061\">Truth Table:</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"380\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1061\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t<table>\n\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>A</th>\n\t\t\t\t<th>B</th>\n\t\t\t\t<th>A + B</th>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</thead>\n\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>0</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td>1</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1061\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1579\" data-start=\"1576\" />",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSS201T",
   "LEVEL": 1,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1"
   ],
